{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomber is a lighthearted arcade puzzle game</strong> designed for kids and families. Your goal is simple: use bombs to blast through walls, find hidden keys, and reach the exit door to complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>How to Play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place bombs to destroy walls and clear the path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for the hidden key to unlock the exit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fun power-ups that give you extra abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 <strong>Power-Ups</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb Range</strong> \u2013 increase the blast range of your bombs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Bombs</strong> \u2013 place more than one bomb at a time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Boost</strong> \u2013 move faster through the maze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra Life</strong> \u2013 gain another chance if you get caught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shield</strong> \u2013 stay protected for a short time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 fun and challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful, kid-friendly graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with keyboard or joystick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, easy-to-learn gameplay \u2014 perfect for quick fun sessions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomber is the perfect <strong>time-killer game for kids and families</strong> who enjoy puzzles, arcade action, and simple fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1352650?t=1758178776","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com